; Behaviour block: a creature that jumps out of the water (kind 13, rooms 16 and 19)
;
; Used by the five magenta imps that leap up from the blood of Lake of despair and the creatures of Underground river
; (attribute $03). After the 5 header bytes: attribute, sprite height, width in bytes, then the addresses of its two
; sprites.
@label=BehaviourJumper
b$9549 DEFB $00,$00,$07,$07,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $954E DEFB $03,$08,$02  ; attribute, sprite height, width (bytes)
 $9551 DEFW $EF4F    ; sprite, frame 0
 $9553 DEFW $EF51    ; sprite, frame 1
